#: ../../../variable/CTEST_BUILD_TARGET.rst:2
msgid "CTEST_BUILD_TARGET"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../variable/CTEST_BUILD_TARGET.rst:4
msgid ""
"Specify the CTest ``BuildTarget`` setting in "
"a :manual:`ctest(1)` :ref:`Dashboard Client` script, or on "
"the :program:`ctest` command line via the :ctest-dashboard-option:`-D` "
"option."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../variable/CTEST_BUILD_TARGET.rst:8
msgid ""
"The :command:`ctest_build` command builds this target instead of the default "
"target when :variable:`CTEST_BUILD_COMMAND` is not set.  The ``TARGET`` "
"option of the command takes priority over this variable."
msgstr ""
